  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Solutions and Enhancing Progress Towards Climate-Conscious Durable Solutions for Displacement Affected People in Urban Centres in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at enhancing climate-conscious durable solutions by mitigating drought-displacement vulnerabilities and strengthening resilience and self-reliance of displacement affected communities towards (re)integration and reduced displacement in Somalia.</narrative>
